Package: publishTC
Type: Package
Title: Publishing Trend-Cycle Components
Version: 0.2.3.9000
Authors@R: c(
  person("Alain", "Quartier-la-Tente", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                 email = "alain.quartier@yahoo.fr",
                 comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7890-3857"))
  )
Description: Tools to facilitate the computation of the trend-cycle component of time series.
  In particular, the computation can be performed using: the Cascade Linear Filter 
  ('CLF', Dagum and Luati (2008) <doi:10.1080/07474930802387837>), classical Henderson 
  symmetric filters with surrogate Musgrave asymmetric filters, local parameterizations of
  Musgrave filters (Quartier-la-Tente (2024) <doi:10.1177/0282423X241283207>), 
  and robust extensions taking into account additive outliers and level shifts 
  (Quartier-la-Tente (2025) <https://insee.hal.science/hal-05622434>). 
  Computes confidence intervals
  and provides specialized plotting functions for publication.
LazyData: true
